        <p>NEDC26 is the flagship event for Economic Development Australia. Established in 2007, EDA has over 2,500 members and State Practitioner Networks across the country.</p>
        <p>EDA's activities are underpinned by four guiding principles: building and supporting a collegial professional sector, promoting a culture of economic development excellence, delivering influence and leadership for the sector, and operating at best practice governance standards.</p>
